OL,3,GNEWSATribute to shopkeeper who died
OL,4,Aafter punch bag machine landed on him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-five who died after a punch
OL,7,Fbag machine landed on him has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as a "friend to many" and " a
OL,9,Fman with a heart of gold".
OL,11,FShop owner Abdo Ali, 52, was working at
OL,12,FShop and Save Mini Market in Toxteth on
OL,13,F29 October when there was a
OL,14,Fdisturbance, Merseyside Police said.
OL,16,FOfficers were called to a row of shops
OL,17,Fon Berkley Street following reports
OL,18,Fthat a punch bag machine had been
OL,19,Fpushed over and landed on Ali.
